{"id": 65, "name": "Claude", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/6/61/Hero651-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142219", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Chase"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["30", "60", "10", "60"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "An excellent thief who comes and goes without a trace.", "skills": [{"name": "Battle Side-by-side", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7d29db8de0b94e9eba7f11ccc9ba5fe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dexter</span> assists Claude on each of his Basic Attacks, dealing 25<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+25% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the same target (inherits a portion of Attack Effects)."}, {"name": "Art of Thievery", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_85c4a7d85b9e8cce8abd73103b799211.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 35", "desc": "Claude emits a disruption wave in the target direction, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area, reducing their Movement Speed by 20% and Attack Speed by 10%.\nFor each enemy hit, he gains 4% Movement and Attack Speed (doubled if hitting enemy heroes) for 6s (up to 5 stacks)."}, {"name": "Battle Mirror Image", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f4ed9a12bdc87446ede283c2565818af.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 90", "desc": "Claude conjures a mirror image of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dexter</s